          "statusId": 1207121,
          "targetCamps": 5,
          "target": "ally",
          "description": "When Corso is carrying [Secret Weapons], she'll throw 1 recently obtained [Secret Weapon] at the closest enemy after her next movement. Different [Secret Weapons] come with different effects. If at the moment of throwing she owns 3 weapons of the same type, she'll cast all of them at once. Each [Secret Weapon] will then deal 50% more damage and come with an enhanced effect.\nThrowing Dagger: Deals (Attack *?%) Physical Damage to enemies. The enhanced throwing dagger guarantees CRIT.\nHand Grenade: Deals (Attack *?%) Physical Damage to all enemies within the 3x3 square around the target enemy. The enhanced hand grenade additionally stuns all enemies within the skill's range for 4 seconds.\nCoin: Deals (Attack *?%) Physical Damage to enemies and attaches 5 stacks of [Electrocution] mark. The enhanced coin additionally attaches 10 stacks of [Electrocution] mark.",
